PRE-TABLE CHECK, TABLE 2 -- #578 jazzvecdeassert, the DELETION form (apply_fix578b.py) measured with the 22-row SELF-CONTAINED probe
jazz_vector_probe.py, written BEFORE any table-2 leg runs (this file's mtime against base_head.raw's in this directory is the order
proof; nothing is written to this file afterwards -- corrections and post-table predictions go to sibling files, one per prediction).
Why a second table: pass 1 (Opus) showed the conditional form can never fire with an effect (invariant I: IRQ3 high implies the pending
and enable predicate; writers enumerated and CHECKED at HEAD and in est -- int_asserted :141/:151, int_enable_mask :459, IRQ3 asserts
:144/:469 only, memset init) and that the conditional text cannot compile in est (no R4030_EXT_IP3 there); and it predicted three
label-keyed re-introductions that escape the 13-row instrument.  So the fix is the deletion and the instrument gained the label rows.
Instrument frozen as killtable2_20261102/jazz_vector_probe.ASRUN.py.  Baseline /tmp/gxfix578b (deletion), HEAD /tmp/gxdivw.

CLAUSE (d) FOR A PURE DELETION: the removed behaviour re-introduced under a DIFFERENT predicate, bounded to the enclosing function's own
tests -- relative_addr {0, 2, other} and writeflag {read, write} -- plus the device-state predicates the old tail could have been keyed
to.  The 22 rows hold every label cell with lines pending (vecw, lbie, lbiew, dflt, and the vector reads), so a label-keyed
re-introduction reds.

CHANNEL per row (table 2): every red is Cause.IP3 reading 0x0 for 0x800 after an access that the mutant keys the deassert to.
  jz ip after / jz ip onevec / jz ip com1   -> offset-0 READS with lines pending
  jz ip vecw                                 -> offset-0 WRITE
  jz ip lbie / jz ip lbiew                   -> offset-2 read / write
  jz ip dflt                                 -> the default arm (offset 1 read)
  jz ip nt, jz ip maskoff, jz ip reheal, jz ip maskon, jz vec *, jz imask, jz com0 *: controls and no-regression rows; green on every
  mutant of the tail by construction (they read state the tail does not write, or IP3 is already 0 there).

