  M_offs0    (d)   18/22   `if (relative_addr == 0)`: after, com1, onevec, vecw
  M_offsne0  (d)   19/22   `if (relative_addr != 0)`: lbie, lbiew, dflt  -- an ESCAPE of the 13-row instrument, closed here
  M_rd       (d)   17/22   `if (writeflag == MEM_READ)`: after, lbie, dflt, com1, onevec
  M_wr       (d)   20/22   `if (writeflag == MEM_WRITE)`: vecw, lbiew    -- an ESCAPE of the 13-row instrument, closed here
  M_offs2    (d)   20/22   `if (relative_addr == 2)`: lbie, lbiew         -- an ESCAPE of the 13-row instrument, closed here
  M_cond     (e)   22/22   the conditional form of the pass-1 brief: EQUIVALENT by invariant I (measured 13/13 as M_del's mirror in table 1)
